RO: Cum ar fi afectata functionarea unui program daca toate rwlock-urile s-ar inlocui cu semafoare binare si toate apelurile rwlock_wrlock si rwlock_rdlock s-ar inlocui cu sem_wait? Justificati raspunsul.

EN: How would affect the functioning of a program the replacement of all rwlocks with binary semaphores and all calls to rwlock_wrlock and rwlock_rdlock are replaced with sem_wait? Justify your answer.

Answer:
The binary semaphores works the same as a mutex, that means that only one mutex can read and change the value of the critical resources. As what it takes for rwlock, more readers can consult the value of the resources and only one writer can modify the value of the resoures. So if we will replace the rwlock_wrlock and rwlock_rdlock with sem wait that we will have mutual exclusion and we will have only one reader and writer at the same time
